      "content": "wait really?? i dont know if i should go to the er. i have a history of really bad migraines and this actually feels kind of similar to the worst ones i've had, just maybe a bit sharper. im pretty sure it's just the migraine kicking in. is it really that serious if it's just a headache?? i hate the er, it takes forever. can i just wait an hour and see if the sumatriptan works?",
